'''Greedier Mode''' is a mode added in ''Afterbirth ♰''. It is unlocked by depositing 500 coins in the Greed Machine.

Playing on Greedier Mode gives '''Ultra Greed''' a second phase where his gold statue form comes to life. This phase is known as '''Ultra Greedier''', and is the final boss of [[Endings|Ending 19]]. Additionally, he performs several new attacks:

* The coin projectiles that Ultra Greedier shoots from his first phase now explode upon contact.
* Slams his fists into the ground, creating explosions where he slams and causing golden {{i|Brimstone}} lasers to fire from the golden Boss Room doors that surround the room.
** They can either come out from one pair of doors at a time or from all of them at once.
* Jumps into the air towards Isaac's position, dropping exploding coins down below while travelling. Upon landing, rock waves are sent in various directions.
* Stomps on the ground four times, causing a slew of Bomb Coins to rain from the ceiling.
** These coins can spawn a single {{e|Penny}} when they explode, providing both healing for Ultra Greedier and extra coins for Isaac.

After defeating Ultra Greedier, he explodes, dropping a {{e|Penny}} and turning the entire room into solid gold. It is at this point that the end chest and the [[Greed Donation Machine]] spawn.
